WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So happy to have you here.
-Thank you.

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so nice to be back here.
-I saw you recently,

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:06.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we were talking about --
You have a baby. Kit.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have a baby.
-How is Kit doing?

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:11.244 size:75% position:38%
-Kit is doing great.
She's 5 months old.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:12.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fantastic.
-And actually,

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been living in New York
for a couple months now.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
-Thank you. Yes.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
And one of the things --
You were so kind.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
You and your wife Alexi
were so kind.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
You recommended a doctor.
-Yeah.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.091 line:92%
-And she's an amazing doctor.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She's great.
-For my child.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I went in with her
to get her shots,

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
and one of the --
This is a cool doctor,

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.532
'cause the first thing she said
to me, she was like,

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:36.369 size:81% position:41%
"Hi. Just so you know,
I don't watch any TV."

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.303 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
And to me, of course,
that meant, like,

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was like a challenge to me.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.444
-She's just not into -- I don't
know if she's said this to you.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.513 size:84% position:42%
Like, she's just like,
"I don't watch any TV."

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I have to say,
if she says that,

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.584
like, she's watched a little.
-She's watched a little TV.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To know that that's something
she needs to tell you.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
And instead of being like,

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.690
"Okay, this is about my
daughter and getting her shots,"

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.894
I was like, "Now I gotta impress
this woman."

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:04.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I was like,
"No? You don't watch any TV?

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
What about films?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:10.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Have you seen
'A Wrinkle in Time'?

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:10.770 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I know Oprah."

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.373
And she's just like, "Truly, I
just need to give your daughter

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
a vaccination
to extend her life."

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.111
And I'm like, "But I was on
'The Office' with Steve Carell."

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And she just --

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
She just didn't care.
But she's a good doctor.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is very exciting,
to be in this "Ocean's 8" film

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
with all these
incredible actresses.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And you guys famously are on

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
a text chain together.
-Yes.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:34.160
-Do you guys still -- Is this
still an existing text chain?

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, we are on
a text chain together.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, what happened was
we have been talking

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:41.968 size:78% position:39%
about the text chain.
So Nora -- Awkwafina,

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.604
who is in the movie -- was like,
"I think someone might hack

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of our phones."
-Right.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.907
-"To get the information,"
which I thought was smart.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we got --
She named some app

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we could have
another text chain.

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:55.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we had to, like,
come up with our fake names

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
on the text chain.
And some of us were...

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.320
just used their first name
because they're more mature.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.890 line:92%
And I was Sarahpaulsonfan69...

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.859 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
...since Sarah Paulson
is in the movie.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:11.264 line:92%
And then she was manboob69.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:11.931 size:75% position:38% line:92%
So that's the level.

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:14.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, that's the level
of discourse that's happening.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.368 line:92%
-Of discourse on this chain.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You obviously,
for a big film like this,

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.771
you've had to do a ton of press.
-Yeah.

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:22.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How has that been?
-It's been mostly great

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:24.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
because the other actresses
are really fun.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's nice
to do press with them.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.749
But today -- You know, so when
you're doing these heist movies,

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
everyone has, like,
their special power,

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.320
which is why Debbie Ocean, like,
pulls us together

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.054 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to do this heist.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.656 size:88% position:44%
And so an interviewer,
this male interviewer --

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:39.459
We're doing international press.
He was -- I was doing press

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Anne Hathaway
and with Sarah Paulson.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:43.963
And he was, like, was asking us,
like, Annie, she's an actress.

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:45.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
In the movie,
she plays an actress.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:48.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Sarah Paulson,
she's a party promoter in it.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:51.204
And then with me, she was like,
okay -- he was like,

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:53.373 line:92%
"Mindy, you play a jeweler.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:56.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Now you are not married
and have never been engaged.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:59.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
So how do you know
about diamonds?"

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:02.482 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:05.385
'Cause it's all about diamonds
and stealing diamond necklaces.

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:08.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "I'm sorry."
So he's basically like,

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:13.259
"How you, a famous spinster..."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:13.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"How would you --

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:17.096
"You've never been anywhere near
a diamond before.

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
No man has ever --"
It's like as though

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you're not married
and engaged,

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:23.036 line:92%
you've never seen a diamond.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:25.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have -- And it was...
-It also seems to be

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:28.741
that he has a fundamental
misunderstanding of acting.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:30.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.711 size:84% position:42%
-Because you could have
said like, "By the way,

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
none of us have robbed
a museum." Yeah.

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:34.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-None of us
have robbed a museum.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he was so incredulous.
-Yeah.

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He was like,
"I can't put this together.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:44.724
"No man has ever loved you.
So in what way would you --"

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:45.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know. It was --
-That strikes me

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
as a very European
press question.

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:51.998
Like, "Yes, we do not -- We ask
the question we think of,

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:54.033 line:92%
and you cannot take offense."

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, without
giving away too much,

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.804 line:92%
yes, that is a correct guess.

00:03:57.804 --> 00:03:58.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:02.375
-You guys filmed at the museum,
at the Met at night.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.143 size:81% position:41%
Was that a cool scene,
to be filming there?

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:07.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. A lot of the movie takes
place at a fake Met Gala.

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.414
And you've been there before...
-Yeah.

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:11.451
-...which is very glamorous.
So for most of the actresses,

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:14.420
they got to wear, like, gowns
and go to the fake Met Gala.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.522 size:81% position:41%
And when I heard about
the script, I thought,

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:20.593
"Oh, this is -- I love fashion,
I love the Met Gala."

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:23.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we were going through
the script,

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.664 line:92%
and all of them are there,

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:30.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I am playing
a short order chef at the Met.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.838 line:92%
So I'm three floors down,

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:34.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
in, like, at the bowels of
the Met, like, washing dishes.

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:38.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
So without giving too much
spoiler alert, like, you know,

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:39.545 line:92%
Sandy is looking so beautiful

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Anne Hathaway
is looking beautiful.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they then they cut to me,
and I'm like --

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:45.518 line:92%
I'm literally washing dishes.

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:46.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I have my earpiece.
And I'm like...

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:49.622
And then I have to go,
"Miguel, I'm going on my break!"

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.057 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:53.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I spend
the rest of the movie

00:04:53.226 --> 00:04:55.495 line:92%
in a large bathroom stall,

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.796 size:81% position:41% line:92%
assembling a necklace.

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:58.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So that's what I got to do.

00:04:58.431 --> 00:04:59.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-But that made sense to me.

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:02.669
That makes sense to me because
you have been to a bathroom.

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.205 line:92%
So I understood this part.

00:05:06.205 --> 00:05:09.008 size:81% position:41% line:92%
This part makes sense.

